name: The Duo — pair X2
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Duo gives X2 Mult if the played hand contains a Pair. First-shop X2 engine: commit
  to Pair hands; Jolly Joker, Sly Joker, and Clever Joker provide the base payoff.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: TheDuo
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: JollyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SlyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheIdol
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
